  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson NXT 17 is a premium multifilament string built with proprietary Xycro microfibers impregnated with polyurethane for exceptional comfort, power and shock absorption. Its X-bonded core is designed to improve tension maintenance and sustain pace over longer periods of play. Wilson also claims a 10% larger sweet spot than traditional synthetic gut with significantly reduced shock. At 1.24 mm, the 17 gauge version is thinner than NXT 16, producing a livelier, more powerful and more responsive feel at the expense of some durability and control. This version is available in Neon Orange.",

    "zh": "Wilson NXT 17 是一款高端多芯球线，采用专有 Xycro 微纤维并注入 Polyurethane 聚氨酯，以提供非常高的舒适性、力量和减震表现。X-Bonded Core 结构用于提升保磅和更持久的力量输出。Wilson 同时表示，NXT 相比传统 Synthetic Gut 拥有约 10% 更大的 Sweet Spot，并显著降低击球冲击。1.24 毫米 / 17 规格比 NXT 16 更细，因此整体更加活跃、更有力量、触球感更明显，但耐久和控制会略低。此版本颜色为 Neon Orange。"
  },

